hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1108","Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj told us, Hafs, meaning Ibn Ghayath, told us, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of Ata’, on the authority of Ubaid bin Umair, on the authority of Aisha, she said: “I have never seen the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, reach any good thing quicker than performing the two rak’ahs before dawn, nor praying the two rak’ahs before dawn.” spoils"
